commands
├── when using the cli
│   ├── it lists all commands in help
│   ├── it rejects unknown commands
│   ├── it rejects invalid ports
│   ├── it rejects an invalid display
│   ├── it reads logs from the selected data directory
│   └── it reports missing logs
├── when managing the service
│   ├── it installs a user unit and registers agents
│   ├── it skips agent registration on request
│   ├── it routes start stop and restart to systemctl
│   ├── it preserves the profile on uninstall
│   ├── it purges the profile on request
│   ├── it rejects start without installation
│   └── it routes journal flags
├── when diagnosing an isolated installation
│   ├── it reports missing dependencies and endpoints
│   └── it reports status without modifying the profile
├── when configuring agents
│   ├── it registers both clients
│   ├── it removes both registrations
│   └── it prints manual setup without clients
└── when checking authentication
    ├── it rejects an error page before mcp
    ├── it rejects background pages before mcp
    └── it accepts a signed in renderer and handshake
